# About me

I am a computational linguist and doctoral student at the [Department of
Linguistics][] at [Ruhr-Universität Bochum][RUB].  My research interests include
corpus linguistics, (semi-)automatic annotation, processing of non-standard
language varieties, and natural language generation.

I worked in various research projects related to [computational historical
linguistics][comphist] supervised by [Stefanie Dipper][].


